 Monica (and back!) with ease.\n2.   Hop on the beach bike path right from our shop.\n3.   Cruise from one place to the next without worrying about parking.\n4.   Take in the best sights at the beach without the sweaty grind of pedaling a traditional pedal-power bike.\n5.  Feel like a kid again with the joy of riding a bike with pedal assist power.\n\n**E-Bike Rental Includes:**\n\n- Single rider e-bike with step-through frame and front basket\n- Lock and helmet\n- 12 Amp Hour Battery, up to 50 mile range\n- 5 level pedal assist\n- Comfortable cushioned seat\n- E-Bike Orientation:  We provide a complete tutorial on the e-bike so you'll know how to use all of the features and feel comfortable riding. Riders must adhere to the safety guidelines agreed to in the rental agreement.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "4 Hour E-Bike Rental", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/beachebiking/items/478891/images/1039772/", "pk": 1039772, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/HFTBR3qsSu6mzf5ei1zy", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/HFTBR3qsSu6mzf5ei1zy", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/beachebiking/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/beachebiking/items/478891/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/HFTBR3qsSu6mzf5ei1zy", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/HFTBR3qsSu6mzf5ei1zy", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/beachebiking/items/478891/images/1022297/", "pk": 1022297, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/fbBwlFpuTPamjVqPM8ZG